    {"entry_index":20,"uid":"zhcn:03bab12a2ca0d891f68aaa60","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了。","source_fingerprint":"65a15e68cae399a07a8f123918970af118dd7b67faaefbf35d524d7dec353a77","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","10021"],"target_text":"Hình như cấp Danh bạ Mã Nương\r\nđã tăng rồi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":21,"uid":"zhcn:b55391f22c696bd405619c2a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"小溪称赞我这件衣服的花样……\r\n是叫……斑点？的颜色很可爱。\r\n我也这么觉得。","source_fingerprint":"406746b74005847eab8da8ec46666b403fa7b80d45f0c05c0e437e8c5f6a35b0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","10025"],"target_text":"Super Creek khen họa tiết trên bộ đồ này của mình...\r\nMàu này gọi là... đốm? Trông dễ thương lắm.\r\nMình cũng thấy vậy.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":22,"uid":"zhcn:54c67a01815740a645d7cb94","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这套服装是服饰店的阿晴推荐，\r\n她说「这样即使到了都市\r\n也没问题」……真的没问题吗？","source_fingerprint":"4df038ef0ab04833f1560b25df192584bd05f56a3c6d69e922b2aba689d15f52","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","10026"],"target_text":"Bộ đồ này do Haru ở cửa hàng quần áo giới thiệu,\r\ncô ấy nói 「Mặc thế này thì lên thành phố\r\ncũng không sao」... thật sự không sao chứ?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":23,"uid":"zhcn:7a32fd3c3a40aff37d09d7c5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我买了练习写硬笔字的书。\r\n因为最近被粉丝要求\r\n签名的机会增加了……","source_fingerprint":"8b27bb782c2c404d8c778d5947daef755d5432ee38bb74697b1f837fc8b77bb4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","10027"],"target_text":"Mình đã mua sách luyện viết chữ bằng bút.\r\nVì dạo gần đây số lần fan nhờ mình\r\nký tên nhiều hơn rồi...","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":24,"uid":"zhcn:30b7d4fc3f179174996887d3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"也是会有这样的状况呢……","source_fingerprint":"d3d408ab44f4641b44f6852194f9a08c79525c242edfb5c751f4c105c3851cdc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1003"],"target_text":"Cũng có lúc như thế này nhỉ...","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":25,"uid":"zhcn:4017375221bb828f9a4c2d6c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"是我们赢了！","source_fingerprint":"2683e66cffb291becf9fcf9338654b262ec1dc080788adf243d2d90ddf838de8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1004"],"target_text":"Chúng ta thắng rồi!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":26,"uid":"zhcn:c672ec31d8ec020913cadc83","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好可惜……","source_fingerprint":"dc7a3196bdd725292db568ae04e5f1966973e71b24298f1c97842e56b5561108","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1005"],"target_text":"Tiếc thật...","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":27,"uid":"zhcn:37712f8d71efc4938b667af4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"也是会有这样的状况呢……","source_fingerprint":"d3d408ab44f4641b44f6852194f9a08c79525c242edfb5c751f4c105c3851cdc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1006"],"target_text":"Cũng có lúc như thế này nhỉ...","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":28,"uid":"zhcn:b5597519907e26e2e22aa582","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好像更新了最高分。","source_fingerprint":"537db6c70b2e59edd1c27177a911e3983a97f869bde8a1695075a70fcde6031c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1007"],"target_text":"Hình như đã lập kỷ lục điểm mới rồi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":29,"uid":"zhcn:dbac1417ea46b0db8f49fb9c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"各位，全力表现吧。","source_fingerprint":"8a7f5a6fa0b95d94fb27c488ee3ac19ed8a5ce1dbbca0f357b427ae2ce8f4a8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1008"],"target_text":"Mọi người, hãy thể hiện hết sức nhé.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":30,"uid":"zhcn:f785e01a27cfbc4a402b54df","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"心強いよ、クリーク。","source_fingerprint":"0caf7e5a87e874affdaabdbe7a263cd2d5d58d1923f209b53c6f0392c10b7698","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1019"],"target_text":"Có cậu bên cạnh là mình yên tâm lắm, Creek.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":31,"uid":"zhcn:4a6e3247e413cfbe7b4b9f45","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就靠你咯，小玉。","source_fingerprint":"f23d47abb65e480f44291d65d064f0d7f5e78f3ef5bab682ebd46218417f9008","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1020"],"target_text":"Trông cậy vào cậu nhé, Tama.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":32,"uid":"zhcn:d4914749c6a38a4afb252ee4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好，加油吧。","source_fingerprint":"1eec042db55a529c2159fe0c952c35f2fe5b11eccc826ca64cfa1bc13d22a8c5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1049"],"target_text":"Được, cố lên nào.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":33,"uid":"zhcn:6f4f142db32803fa2fa24730","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"私はお腹を…！","source_fingerprint":"d0b08ef4b3f59b22ee5e0f70de064a7c0fe2987dc78351630745c2eae5b4aef5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1006","1073"],"target_text":"Còn mình thì bụng...!","reviewed":true},
